  - EntryId: 27479224
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.title.camcorder
    Value: Camcorder
  - EntryId: 13199872
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.description.camcorder
    Value: Illuminate the darkness. Equipped with night vision technology, this camcorder
      is perfect for exploring and documenting in low light conditions.
  - EntryId: 52214045
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.title.lantern
    Value: Lantern
  - EntryId: 10453279
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.description.lantern
    Value: A reliable source of light for any adventurer. Lantern flame is bright
      and steady, providing a comforting glow that illuminates your surroundings.
  - EntryId: 58743985
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.title.lighter
    Value: Lighter
  - EntryId: 35147977
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.description.lighter
    Value: A reliable source of fire for any adventurer. With its compact size and
      easy-to-use design, the lighter is a must-have item.
  - EntryId: 47759722
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.title.candle
    Value: Candle
  - EntryId: 88800642
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.description.candle
    Value: Compact, yet valuable for light and warmth in the darkness with its long-lasting
      burn time.
  - EntryId: 64813928
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.title.axe
    Value: Axe
  - EntryId: 81754557
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.description.axe
    Value: 'Sturdy wood-handled tool with a sharp metal blade, ideal for chopping
      and potential self-defense.     '
  - EntryId: 29595890
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.title.pocketknife
    Value: Pocket Knife
  - EntryId: 10912878
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.description.pocketknife
    Value: Compact folding blade, versatile for cutting tasks and close-quarters
      defense. Always handy to have.
  - EntryId: 53741014
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.title.pistol
    Value: Pistol
  - EntryId: 19660599
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.description.pistol
    Value: A trusty sidearm for close-range combat. This powerful weapon packs a
      punch and can be a lifesaver in dangerous situations.
  - EntryId: 61872019
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.title.thermometer
    Value: Thermometer
  - EntryId: 78303727
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.description.thermometer
    Value: Measures the temperature of your surroundings. Useful for detecting environmental
      changes.
  - EntryId: 58318911
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.title.emfmeter
    Value: EMF Meter
  - EntryId: 33905725
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.description.emfmeter
    Value: Detects electromagnetic fields. Essential for identifying paranormal activity
      or electronic disturbances. A must-have for ghost hunters and investigators.
  - EntryId: 34833445
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.title.firstaidkit
    Value: First AID KIT
  - EntryId: 95076873
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.description.firstaidkit
    Value: A vital survival tool packed with essential medical supplies. Use to restore
      health and treat minor injuries. Useful in emergencies.
  - EntryId: 44235869
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.title.medicaloil
    Value: Medical Oil
  - EntryId: 59674130
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.description.medicaloil
    Value: Effective, fast-acting drug. It is used to alleviate a variety of illnesses,
      increase the speed of recovery, and boost health at critical moments.
  - EntryId: 39924894
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.title.medicalherb
    Value: Medical Herb
  - EntryId: 10202328
    SectionId: 24283221
    Key: item.description.medicalherb
    Value: Rare and powerful flora with healing properties. It is used to restore
      a moderate amount of health or to make powerful healing potions and medicines.
