    Key: subobjetives.distrae_epecuenses
    Value: Distract the guard
  - EntryId: 15318123
    SectionId: 12708451
    Key: subobjetives.encuentra_combustible
    Value: Find the fuel on the way to the slaughterhouse
  - EntryId: 71018563
    SectionId: 12708451
    Key: subobjetives.al_pueblo
    Value: Address the people
  - EntryId: 88446583
    SectionId: 38271540
    Key: dialogs.mission1.picture.frame
    Value: "It doesn\u2019t feel real that you\u2019re gone, Dad. I don\u2019t understand
      how the hospital couldn\u2019t do anything to save you."
  - EntryId: 25660704
    SectionId: 38271540
    Key: dialogs.mission1.letter1
    Value: We had such wonderful vacations in Mar del Plata.
  - EntryId: 78023030
    SectionId: 38271540
    Key: dialogs.mission1.letter2
    Value: The love letters Mom used to send Dad.
  - EntryId: 12305486
    SectionId: 38271540
    Key: dialogs.mission1.books
    Value: Dad used to love horror stories.
  - EntryId: 63409302
    SectionId: 38271540
    Key: dialogs.mission1.mate
    Value: "I can\u2019t believe I won\u2019t get to enjoy those long talks and mate
      with Dad anymore."
  - EntryId: 77435737
    SectionId: 38271540
    Key: dialogs.mission1.clothes
    Value: "What am I going to do with all these clothes? I guess I\u2019ll have
      to donate them to the church."
  - EntryId: 87732939
    SectionId: 38271540
    Key: dialogs.mission1.door
    Value: I should keep looking for more information.
  - EntryId: 28608808
    SectionId: 38271540
    Key: dialogs.mission1.window
    Value: The weather is really bad today
  - EntryId: 71346679
    SectionId: 38271540
    Key: dialogs.mission1.main.letter
    Value: "Son, you need to know that they\u2019ve discovered me, and I can\u2019t
      keep helping you anymore. Trust no one. If you don\u2019t return to Epecu\xE9n,
      the illness will eventually consume you."
  - EntryId: 81320009
    SectionId: 38271540
    Key: dialogs.mission1.intro
    Value: "My father died before he could tell me something important\u2026 he said
      it was a family secret\u2026 Since then\u2026 I haven\u2019t been able to stop
      thinking about it."
  - EntryId: 63534897
    SectionId: 38271540
    Key: dialogs.PostAbuelo
    Value: That city again... Did he know about the illness? I'd better pay him a
      visit.
  - EntryId: 83540004
    SectionId: 38271540
    Key: dialogs.dolorcabeza
    Value: Oh, these headaches...
  - EntryId: 85472762
    SectionId: 38271540
    Key: dialogs.suero
    Value: These are the vitamins I always gave myself.
  - EntryId: 22915260
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.limite.carretera
    Value: " I don't think the town is around here\u2026"
  - EntryId: 16471321
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.desequipar.linterna
    Value: Uh, this flashlight doesn't work anymore, I'll have to throw it away.
  - EntryId: 27943259
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.Olvido
    Value: " This place has been forgotten\u2026"
  - EntryId: 75171280
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.posteluz
    Value: A kerosene lamp? Is there no electricity around here?
  - EntryId: 51158971
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.nene.che
    Value: Hey, kid!
  - EntryId: 80669082
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.nene.para
    Value: " Hey, wait\u2026 don't go."
  - EntryId: 79278245
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.arvol.caida
    Value: Damn! I don't have time for this... I have to find another way.
  - EntryId: 43885748
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.niebla
    Value: "This wasn't here before\u2026 what's going on?"
  - EntryId: 91080227
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.firshouse
    Value: ' Hello? Is anyone there?'
  - EntryId: 51662929
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.secondhouse
    Value: Another cabin?
  - EntryId: 78003352
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.silla
    Value: "Someone was here recently\u2026"
  - EntryId: 32551320
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.medicina
    Value: '"They''re the same jars... the ones from home..." "Maybe... this is what
      kept Dad alive."'
  - EntryId: 86614006
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.linternakero
    Value: "Well\u2026 light. It's not much, but it helps."
  - EntryId: 77694860
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.foto.abuelo
    Value: "This is the same photo\u2026 is that my grandfather? I have to find him."
  - EntryId: 27680312
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.golpepuerta
    Value: Who's there...?
  - EntryId: 77776079
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.lider
    Value: That guy... he gave me the creeps.
  - EntryId: 90674968
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.advertencia1
    Value: ' Strangers are not welcome'
  - EntryId: 40298081
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.advertencia2
    Value: The leader is our salvation
  - EntryId: 12090252
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.advertencia3
    Value: Those who disobey will be punished.
  - EntryId: 30153132
    SectionId: 11930759
    Key: dialogs_pueblo.bosque.cercaentrada
    Value: null
  - EntryId: 19299357
    SectionId: 65177942
    Key: dialogsSintomas.sintoma.A1
    Value: " What the hell is happening to me\u2026?"
  - EntryId: 82958904
    SectionId: 65177942
    Key: dialogsSintomas.sintoma.A2
    Value: "No, not again\u2026"
  - EntryId: 64040201
    SectionId: 65177942
    Key: dialogsSintomas.sintoma.A3
    Value: "In the end\u2026 the same thing is happening to me as to my old man"
  - EntryId: 93875838
    SectionId: 65177942
    Key: dialogsSintomas.sintoma.A4
    Value: "it 's got me again\u2026"
  - EntryId: 78044263
    SectionId: 65177942
    Key: dialogsSintomas.sintoma.A5
    Value: "I have to get that IV drip in now\u2026"
  - EntryId: 78132164
    SectionId: 65177942
    Key: dialogsSintomas.sintoma.A6
    Value: ' I can''t take it anymore... I need an IV drip.'
  - EntryId: 59629219
    SectionId: 65177942
    Key: dialogsSintomas.bosque.carta.abuelo
    Value: This won't cure the disease, but at least it will help ease the symptoms
      and provide some relief while the body holds out... I'm still working on finding
      a real cure, one that will change the course of the disease... and I think
      I'm on the verge of succeeding...
  - EntryId: 97409758
    SectionId: 65177942
    Key: dialogsSintomas.bosque.respuesta.carta.abuelo
    Value: "I watched my father waste away day after day\u2026 I watched as that
      disease robbed him of his voice, his strength\u2026 his life. I\u2019m not
      going to sit idly by and wait for the same fate."
  - EntryId: 58631134
    SectionId: 50914226
    Key: inventoryItems.Salt.Tittle
    Value: Epecuen's salt
  - EntryId: 14815089
    SectionId: 50914226
    Key: inventoryItems.salt.description
    Value: ' Crystals extracted from Lake Epecuen, their properties help to extend
      life'
  - EntryId: 71713302
    SectionId: 55496470
    Key: dialog_ingreso_pueblo.intro_ingreso1
    Value: This place scares me
  - EntryId: 57736921
    SectionId: 55496470
    Key: dialog_ingreso_pueblo.intro_ingreso2
    Value: There are people guarding the entrance, I need to find another way in..
  - EntryId: 68139067
    SectionId: 55496470
    Key: dialog_ingreso_pueblo.feria_cerrado
    Value: Hmm, it seems I can't go any further this way. I'll see if there's another
      entrance through the fence
  - EntryId: 91826483
    SectionId: 55496470
    Key: dialog_ingreso_pueblo.maizal
    Value: "Est\xE1 plagado de estas criaturas\u2026  Voy a tener que perderme entre
      el maizal para evitarlos"
  - EntryId: 42857841
    SectionId: 55496470
    Key: "dialog_ingreso_pueblo.Persecuci\xF3n1"
    Value: What the hell is that?
  - EntryId: 63575913
    SectionId: 55496470
    Key: dialog_ingreso_pueblo.esconderse
    Value: That bathroom... please let it be open!
  - EntryId: 49913073
    SectionId: 55496470
    Key: dialog_ingreso_pueblo.voces_forasteros
    Value: An intruder... we have to find him and warn the leader that we have a
      visitor...
  - EntryId: 60315446
    SectionId: 55496470
    Key: dialog_ingreso_pueblo.lluvia
    Value: That was the last straw, he just left.
  - EntryId: 57025345
    SectionId: 55496470
    Key: dialog_ingreso_pueblo.puente
    Value: No way, the bridge collapsed, I'll have to find something to help me get
      back up.
  - EntryId: 13376603
    SectionId: 55496470
    Key: dialog_ingreso_pueblo.granero
    Value: How could the lights have turned on? Who's there?
  - EntryId: 88846228
    SectionId: 55496470
    Key: dialog_ingreso_pueblo.combustible_granero
    Value: This generator isn't working. I'll have to find the fuel and the missing
      part.
  - EntryId: 75148231
    SectionId: 55496470
    Key: dialog_ingreso_pueblo.esconderse_granero
    Value: Someone's coming! I have to hide under the table.
  - EntryId: 12293059
    SectionId: 55496470
    Key: dialog_ingreso_pueblo.nota_gauchito
    Value: '"Gauchito Gil," a popular Argentine saint widely venerated, though not
      recognized by the Church. People ask him for protection during travels, health,
      work, and good fortune; for this reason, travelers leave red shrines as a sign
      of faith and gratitude.'
  - EntryId: 72492651
    SectionId: 55496470
    Key: dialog_ingreso_pueblo.nota_sanla
    Value: "\u201CSan La Muerte\u201D is a pagan or folk saint. What distinguishes
      him from any other saint is that he can be asked to perform evil or harm: for
      his devotees, he has the ability to protect against an enemy and the power
      to punish them for their ill intentions."
  - EntryId: 62613490
    SectionId: 55496470
    Key: dialog_ingreso_pueblo.crafteo_ganzua
    Value: By combining 2 pieces of scrap metal we get the lockpick.
  - EntryId: 10387736
    SectionId: 55496470
    Key: dialog_ingreso_pueblo.distraccion_guardia
    Value: I need to find a way to distract the guard at the entrance.
  - EntryId: 21320959
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.banio_title
    Value: Hide
  - EntryId: 63664189
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.banio_description
    Value: You can hide somewhere to avoid being found by enemies
  - EntryId: 70620009
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.banio_keyprompt
    Value: to enter
  - EntryId: 81562794
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.banio_warning
    Value: Be careful, they can find you
  - EntryId: 50821281
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.button
    Value: Acept
  - EntryId: 62678960
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.save_tittle
    Value: Save Game
  - EntryId: 80935025
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.save_description
    Value: You can save your game at these altars
  - EntryId: 45363174
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.save_keyprompt
    Value: to save
