    Key: popups.timer_title
    Value: Timer
  - EntryId: 40359982
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.timer_description
    Value: The disease progresses over time. Your body weakens, and you experience
      various symptoms.
  - EntryId: 74963393
