      you.
  - EntryId: 14660687
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.potion_title
    Value: Red Potion
  - EntryId: 17372708
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.potion_description
    Value: Take this potion to temporarily relieve the symptoms affecting your body
      and mind.
  - EntryId: 74648826
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.potion_keyprompt
    Value: to open the inventory
  - EntryId: 25267443
    SectionId: 32159731
