    Value: Its effect is temporary, so use it wisely.
  - EntryId: 28234744
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.linterna_title
    Value: Lantern
  - EntryId: 10147527
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.linterna_description
    Value: You can add a quick-access "Shortcut" to usable items, such as the lantern,
      by using the shortcut option and pressing a number from 1 to 4 to assign it
      as a quick-access shortcut.
  - EntryId: 26761011
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.linterna_warning
    Value: Use these shortcuts to quickly turn features on and off and save resources.
  - EntryId: 93786877
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.oil_title
    Value: Petrol Oil
  - EntryId: 53971390
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.oil_description
    Value: "When the lantern goes out, you can refill it with kerosene by selecting
      the \u201CCombine\u201D option in your inventory and selecting the lantern. "
  - EntryId: 97863555
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.oil_warning
    Value: To charge the lantern, it must be turned on; otherwise, it won't charge.
  - EntryId: 40083569
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.super_potion_title
    Value: Super Potion
  - EntryId: 38382339
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.super_potion_description
    Value: "Combine \u201CEpecuen Salt\u201D with \u201CRed Potion\u201D to create
      \u201CSuper Potion,\u201D which gives you 10 more minutes of life and alleviates
      your symptoms."
  - EntryId: 72907992
    SectionId: 32159731
    Key: popups.super_potion_warning
    Value: Salt is a more limited resource than red serums, so use it wisely.
